.TH sam-jail-cleanup 1 2026-11-10 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM Manual"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-cleanup \- Remove extraction leftovers not referenced by any app
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail cleanup\fR [\fB\-\-data\fR] [\fB\-\-list\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove extraction leftovers not referenced by any app
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-data\fR
Also (or with \-\-list: only list) the private data of apps whose sandbox was removed with \-\-keep\-data
.TP
\fB\-\-list\fR
Only list what would be removed
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
